			<item>
				<title>Flappy Bird Clone for Game Boy</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/en/projects/flappy-bird-clone-gba/</link>
				<pubDate>Tue, 12 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/en/projects/flappy-bird-clone-gba/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;A small Flappy Bird clone for Game Boy Advance, written in Rust with the &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/agbrs/agb&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;agb&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; crate. The version below runs directly in the browser through &lt;a href=&#34;https://emulatorjs.org/&#34;&gt;EmulatorJS&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;gba-embed&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;iframe&#xA;    src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/games/flappy-bem-te-vi/&#34;&#xA;    title=&#34;Flappy Bem-te-vi&#34;&#xA;    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    allowfullscreen&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Project links:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/games/flappy-bem-te-vi/flappy-bem-te-vi.gba&#34;&gt;Download GBA ROM&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/Alexsandr0x/flappy-bem-te-vi&#34;&gt;GitHub repository&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
